nt activity, and restore functionality redirects  \u001b[2m│\u001b[22m            \u001b[2m│\u001b[22m                      \u001b[2m│\u001b[22m            \u001b[2m│\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m      \u001b[2m│\u001b[22m to FAQ instead of working                             \u001b[2m│\u001b[22m            \u001b[2m│\u001b[22m                      \u001b[2m│\u001b[22m            \u001b[2m│\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m├──────\u001b[22m\u001b[2m┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[22m\u001b[2m┼────────────\u001b[22m\u001b[2m┼──────────────────────\u001b[22m\u001b[2m┼────────────┤\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m \u001b[2m#45… \u001b[2m│\u001b[22m Organization was deleted but associated project       \u001b[2m│\u001b[22m \u001b[32mresolved\u001b[39m   \u001b[2m│\u001b[22m tondroit, Hallidayo  \u001b[2m│\u001b[22m \u001b[2m-\u001b[22m          \u001b[2m│\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m      \u001b[2m│\u001b[22m remains running and inaccessible in dashboard         \u001b[2m│\u001b[22m            \u001b[2m│\u001b[22m                      \u001b[2m│\u001b[22m            \u001b[2m│\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m├──────\u001b[22m\u001b[2m┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[22m\u001b[2m┼────────────\u001b[22m\u001b[2m┼──────────────────────\u001b[22m\u001b[2m┼────────────┤\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m \u001b[2m#45… \u001b[2m│\u001b[22m User's Supabase project is unreachable and            \u001b[2m│\u001b[22m \u001b[32mresolved\u001b[39m   \u001b[2m│\u001b[22m corwin-glitch,       \u001b[2m│\u001b[22m \u001b[2m-\u001b[22m          \u001b[2m│\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m      \u001b[2m│\u001b[22m tables/edge functions not loading in UI               \u001b[2m│\u001b[22m            \u001b[2m│\u001b[22m GaryAustin1          \u001b[2m│\u001b[22m            \u001b[2m│\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2m├──────\u001b[22m\u001b[2m┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[22m\u001b[2m┼────────────\u001b[22m\u001b[2m┼──